  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>EIC 2023 & 2025 Merit Award</li>
    <li>CDE Innovation & Research Award (High Achievement)</li>
    <li>NUS Outstanding Undergraduate Researcher Prize (Group)</li>
    <li>IAHR-Singapore Hydraulics Medal</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
