  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>President, NUS Civil Engineering Club (Aug 2023 – Aug 2024)</li>
    <li>AUA Youth Forum 2024 Best Presenter</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Languages</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>English (Native)</li>
    <li>Mandarin (Mother Tongue)</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>Python</li>
    <li>PyTorch</li>
    <li>TensorFlow</li>
    <li>Scikit-learn</li>
    <li>XGBoost</li>
    <li>OpenCV</li>
